WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.300
Welcome to Innov8 Elevators. I'm Paul Jacob, and I'm glad you're here.

00:04.300 --> 00:11.450
Starting today, you lead our regional sales team. Ten people, across five stages, from the first call to the signed contract.

00:11.450 --> 00:17.550
Some of them are thriving. Some are new. And one or two are struggling, and haven't told anyone yet.

00:17.550 --> 00:27.150
We sell four Levo lifts, for offices, homes, shopping centres and hospitals. Every lift starts as a lead, and moves through your team one stage at a time.

00:27.150 --> 00:33.600
If one stage gets stuck, everything after it waits. So watch where the work piles up, and who is standing there.

00:33.600 --> 00:38.800
Here's what I need. Two hundred and forty thousand dollars in signed business, in eight weeks.

00:38.800 --> 00:48.300
And here's what matters just as much. When those eight weeks are over, I want a team that's stronger than the one you found. A burned out team won't hold the number next quarter.

00:48.300 --> 00:57.200
Your people need different things from you. Some need clear steps. Some need room to run. Get to know them, talk to them, and lead each one the way they need.

00:57.200 --> 01:00.150
Keep me in the loop. I notice when I don't hear from you.

01:00.150 --> 01:03.300
Your first week starts now. Make it count.
